                      "Small Business Use" means use by a For-Profit
                      Organization that, together with its affiliates, had
                      total gross revenue below USD 1,000,000 and fewer than 10
                      people working for it in its last completed fiscal year,
                      or that has not yet completed a fiscal year and
                      reasonably expects to meet both limits in its first one.
                      The people working for it are its employees and the
                      individuals who work for it on a regular basis as
                      contractors, counted as individuals and not as
                      companies. An "affiliate" is any entity that controls,
                      is controlled by, or is under common control with
